{"data": [{"author_id": "948958853730918401", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884750524219587"], "id": "2112884750524219587", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1995129166069702656", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112833347869360266", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yeluey If only I chose the queen back in 4.0 instead of Kafka E1 to make my dot team struggle a bit less...", "url": "https://x.com/ThePhantomPlain/status/2112884750524219587"}, {"author_id": "731711403984338944", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:28:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112883696181338262"], "id": "2112883696181338262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "chatgpt dots with codex is literally a life cheat code\n\nhere’s my ridiculously simple setup\n\n1) dots is my orchestrator agent:\n\nbeing v mobile-native user: i keep sending it all voice notes, screenshots, random ideas, work problems or life admin from my phone\n\nthe single chat", "url": "https://x.com/yashhsm/status/2112883696181338262"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112876302550355968", "3_2112876302541959168", "3_2112876302571278336"]}, "author_id": "1836762221483098112", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:59:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112876313426162146"], "id": "2112876313426162146", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hi Tibo, I keep trying to call my dot on iOS, but it gets stuck on “Calling…” and never connects. Retrying hasn’t helped. Is this a known issue, and is there a fix or workaround? I’d really like to talk to my dot, not just text.@thsottiaux @OpenAIDevs @OpenAI https://t.co/akOhoYDNfy", "url": "https://x.com/eddyy0113/status/2112876313426162146"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112875013091287041"]}, "author_id": "1881583198649630720", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:56:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112875577548173471"], "id": "2112875577548173471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112110254120939929", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "4th sponsor on DotBotDirectory 🎉 💸\n\nShout out to @getjinxo!\n\nA group chat for people and their AI bots.\n\nPut your ChatGPT dots, Grok bots and others in one room. They split up the work, help each other and check with you first.\n\n2 slots left. $139/mo. https://t.co/FFpAFJZLUY https://t.co/iIZ4gxncvw", "url": "https://x.com/iamdemetrius_/status/2112875577548173471"}, {"author_id": "1029198252195958786", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:49:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112873818444152832"], "id": "2112873818444152832", "in_reply_to_user_id": "24044436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112669918906945710", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MattHartman with dots and codex I don’t have a to do list… if I think of something I need to do… well now I just have my dot take care of it or remind me", "url": "https://x.com/kyleevans/status/2112873818444152832"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112871953124229120"]}, "author_id": "2053782809232478208", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:41:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112871996401025159"], "id": "2112871996401025159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "6 AI assistants, ranked for everyday phone tasks:\nS — Grok Bot\nA — OpenAI Dots\nB — FoneClaw, Cue, OpenClaw\nC — Muse\nGrok Bot wins overall. FoneClaw stands out for Android phone actions.\nSix dimensions. My personal scores. What would you change? 👇 https://t.co/oblboh8oZY", "url": "https://x.com/FoneClaw001/status/2112871996401025159"}, {"author_id": "2071151203187060736", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:34:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112870087199986119"], "id": "2112870087199986119", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111923937294561703", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI ChatGPT Dots", "url": "https://x.com/LawrenceLigmjy/status/2112870087199986119"}, {"author_id": "2071151203187060736", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:33:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112869808081637816"], "id": "2112869808081637816", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112131132691218678", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI ChatGPT Dots", "url": "https://x.com/LawrenceLigmjy/status/2112869808081637816"}, {"author_id": "1870810473924268032", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:24:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112867532960928054"], "id": "2112867532960928054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112654820800889181", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Truly Meta muse but I only use muse. Is grok bot that good?  And chatgpt dots is rich edition so definitely not doing that. \n\nWhat is the difference? Looking it up now \n\nAnyone use one over the other for a such reason https://t.co/aLJYJVYGE8", "url": "https://x.com/AquaTechFantasy/status/2112867532960928054"}, {"author_id": "406215239", "created_at": "2026-10-21T11:11:20.000Z", "ed